From: Sobs <antohasobne@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mainui: load or save the game the save list activates

Enter or the gamepad's A on a line of the save list did nothing: the list
model had no OnActivateEntry. With a gamepad the arrows stay in the list
and never reach the Load/Save buttons, so a game could not be loaded from
the menu. Activating a line now does what those buttons do.

diff --git a/3rdparty/mainui/menus/LoadGame.cpp b/3rdparty/mainui/menus/LoadGame.cpp
index 51ed816..8ad6d49 100644
--- a/3rdparty/mainui/menus/LoadGame.cpp
+++ b/3rdparty/mainui/menus/LoadGame.cpp
@@ -134,6 +134,9 @@ public:
 	}
 
 	void OnDeleteEntry( int line ) override;
+	// Enter or the gamepad's A on a line does what the Load/Save button does:
+	// with a gamepad the arrows stay in the list and never reach the buttons
+	void OnActivateEntry( int line ) override;
 private:
 	CMenuLoadGame *parent;
 };
@@ -374,6 +377,14 @@ void CMenuLoadGame::_Init( void )
 	AddItem( savesList );
 }
 
+void CMenuSavesListModel::OnActivateEntry( int line )
+{
+	if( parent->IsSaveMode( ))
+		parent->SaveGame();
+	else
+		parent->LoadGame();
+}
+
